  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Works contract for the Rehabilitation/Upgrading of Slaughter House Facility in Sanga, Kiruhura District, Uganda in Disease Control Zones (DCZ) 2.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This local abattoir within the project area is in need of improvement in order to meet livestock and meat handling standards in an effort to reduce the consumers&#xbf; health hazard related to the risk of food-borne diseases. When renovated, this local abattoir will make available safer and cleaner meat, and provide the value chain actors with the option to increase local and safe slaughter, increase job opportunities and reduce the risk of spreading diseases through the transport of live animals to Kampala&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
